# VesperOS's own packages (PKGBUILDs in the vesperos repository), in build
# order. Built only when the sources can be fetched: the repositories are
# private, so the build needs VESPER_SOURCES_TOKEN (a read-only token).
vesper-compo
vesper-menus
vesper-settings
vesper-player
vesper-filebrowser
vesper-web-browser
vesper-keyboard
vesper-store
vesperos-splash
# River (river-tv): built from the public River repository.
river-tv
# BBC iPlayer (the BBC's TV app in Chromium).
vesper-iplayer
# Channel 4 (its TV app in Chromium; Widevine comes from Google on the TV).
vesper-channel4
vesper-session
